    "upgrade_notice": {
        "4.2.2": "<p>Security release that tightens co-author permission checks and comment emails. Unlinked guest authors no longer receive moderation emails. Update soon.</p>",
        "4.2.1": "<p>Security and bug fix release that tightens how co-authors and author queries are matched. export-coauthors now requires --file. If you ran it without --file on 4.2.0, delete wp-content/cap-coauthors-export.json. Update soon.</p>",
        "4.2.0": "<p>Includes behaviour changes: feeds now credit co-authors, managing guest authors needs the manage capability on every screen, and core REST author routes need edit_posts. If you customise permissions, feeds or REST, read the changelog first.</p>"
